s, 30% now, with four rackings over 18\n\u2018months.\n\nTASTING NOTES\nExhibiting complex layers of raspberry, plum, and black cherry, accented by crushed roses,\npencil shavings, and smoky coder nuances, this ful-bodied, vigorous Merlot burst with\n\u2018avers of macerated berries, coffe, and krsch. Charming and roe, it firms upto finish with\nistying longevity\n\nLEcole\n\naro\n\nre\n\nMERLOT\n\nHARVEST DATA\n\n\u2018Average pH 245\n\n\u2018Average Aci Sat.\n\nWINE DATA\n\n14% CABERNET FRANC,\n\u20184% MALBEC,\nTota Acide soot\nRelease Date \u2018APR 2021\n(ase Production 5.200\n\nPO BOX 1\n\n1 + LOWDEN, WASHINGTON 99260 + (509) 525.0940",
